  "description": "Peak 1500W High Torque Off-Road Power\n\nPeak 1000W brushless motor delivers instant acceleration and strong climbing capacity, easily conquers steep slopes, rocky trails and rough dirt roads, ideal for mountain trail outdoor cycling.\n\n52V 15Ah UL2849 Long Range Removable Battery\n\nUL2849 safety certified detachable lithium battery, full charge supports 35 miles throttle mode and 80 miles pedal assist range. Detachable design enables convenient indoor charging and anti-theft storage for all-day outdoor trips.\n\n5 Riding Modes & Smart LCD Control Screen\n\n5 versatile adjustable riding modes (throttle / 5-level PAS / walk assist / hybrid / manual cycling) fit all terrain demands. Real-time LCD dashboard clearly shows speed, battery level, mileage and working mode for easy operation.\n\nShimano 21-Speed & Hydraulic Dual Disc Brakes\n\nProfessional Shimano 21-speed transmission realizes smooth shifting on hills and uneven paths. Front & rear hydraulic disc brakes offer stable reliable stopping power in rainy or dry conditions for safer off-road riding.\n\nDurable Frame & Worry-Free Complete After-Sales\n\nMixed carbon steel + 6061 aluminum frame supports max 330lbs load, matched 26×1.95 anti-slip MTB tires for gravel and mountain roads. 90% pre-assembled for quick setup in 20 mins.",
